sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant UI as React console (Records)
  participant API as FastAPI watchlist routes
  participant Repo as WatchlistRepository
  participant DB as Database
  Op->>UI: Open Records
  UI->>API: GET /api/watchlist
  API->>Repo: list_people()
  Repo->>DB: Query people
  API-->>UI: People, their signals and decision counts
  alt Edit details
    Op->>UI: Change name or notes
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/watchlist/person-id
    API->>Repo: Update person
    Repo->>DB: Save
  else Replace footage
    Op->>UI: Upload newer footage
    UI->>API: POST /api/enroll with replace set
    Note over API,Repo: Same steps as UC2 Enrol person
  else Retire or restore
    Op->>UI: Confirm Retire or Restore
    UI->>API: DELETE /api/watchlist/person-id or POST .../restore
    API->>Repo: retire() or restore()
    Repo->>DB: Update record and write audit event
  end
  API-->>UI: Updated record
  UI-->>Op: Show result
